~ fallback_look

% Unknown: Nothing remarkable. Like me, apparently. [ID:CORE_FALLBACK_LOOK_1]
% Unknown: It keeps its secrets. Everyone does, around here. [ID:CORE_FALLBACK_LOOK_2]
% Unknown: I stare at it. It doesn't stare back. That's something. [ID:CORE_FALLBACK_LOOK_3]

=> END

~ fallback_use

% Unknown: My hands have no opinion on that. [ID:CORE_FALLBACK_USE_1]
